  "summary": "An overflowing output sum was an internal error instead of an invalid block",
  "details": "connect_block returned an internal error for a block whose output sum overflowed. The fix classifies that block as invalid. Callers that treated the internal error as a retry or a crash could disagree with a caller that rejected the block. Reporter credit is blank pending consent. The report date was not in the commit or the tag.",
